<div class="arc-modal-overlay" id="policyModalOverlay">
    <div class="arc-modal-card">
        <div class="arc-modal-header">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: var(--arc-accent);"></i> Privacy & Fair Play Policy</h3>
            <button type="button" class="arc-btn arc-btn-icon" onclick="document.getElementById('policyModalOverlay').classList.remove('open')">
                <i class="fas fa-times"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div class="arc-modal-body" style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--arc-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
            <h4 style="color: var(--arc-text-main); margin-bottom: 6px;">1. Arcade Data & Privacy</h4>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Pocket Classics operates as an integrated entertainment hub for GPLMods. Player high scores, wins, playtime, and room matchmaking use secure identifiers. No unauthorized third-party trackers are injected.</p>

            <h4 style="color: var(--arc-text-main); margin-bottom: 6px;">2. Fair Play & Multiplayer Integrity</h4>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Multiplayer rooms are protected by real-time server turn verification. Automated bots, move injection, or unsportsmanlike behavior will lead to temporary or permanent Arcade matchmaking suspensions.</p>

            <h4 style="color: var(--arc-text-main); margin-bottom: 6px;">3. Asset Protection</h4>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">All game sprites, sounds, audio tracks, and logos are intellectual properties protected against unauthorized rip or commercial distribution.</p>

            <h4 style="color: var(--arc-text-main); margin-bottom: 6px;">4. Club Room Invitations</h4>
            <p>Private room invite codes generated inside games are ephemeral and expire automatically once rooms close.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="arc-modal-footer">
            <button type="button" class="arc-btn arc-btn-accent" onclick="document.getElementById('policyModalOverlay').classList.remove('open')">
                I Understand
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
